erson County runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle ran 149% of normal in April to May and 43% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 33% of normal and April to May at 45%.</p>"}
